      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Everything comes together here: a Missile Body, a warhead and a Launch Control, with the pad and the fuel loader you already built. Hold all three to finish the quest, then go and fire it.\n\nStack the missile on the pad, arm it, fill the tank and set a target. Press Launch, or give the Launch Control a redstone pulse. A 10-second countdown starts, and Abort still stands the missile down, armed and fueled. After ignition there\u0027s no turning back: the missile climbs, flies its arc and detonates on impact. A Tier 1 flight at full range takes about a minute. The pad, the fuel loader and the Launch Control come through unharmed.\n\nNext: a Tier 2 missile, radar and air defense, and the Missile Silo.\n\n[warn]Make sure nobody stands at the target, you included. A missile that is shot down still goes off where it is hit.[/warn]",
